{"id":"b7fba16631c9dc54","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/570_Artemov_Logic_of_Proofs_LP.md","title":"570 Artemov Logic of Proofs LP","display":"570_Artemov_Logic_of_Proofs_LP","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PConst}_{570}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{PConst}_{570}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}\\)</span>；公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\\)</span>。显示约定与第 569 号不同文件无关，在本文件中定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sum}(s,t)=s+t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{app}(s,t)=s\\cdot t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{bang}(t)=!t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{just}(t,A)=t:A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sum}(s,t)=s+t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{app}(s,t)=s\\cdot t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{bang}(t)=!t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{just}(t,A)=t:A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项、公式与迭代常元式\">2. 项、公式与迭代常元式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{570}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{570}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec c:k\\to\\mathsf{PConst}_{570}\">\\(\\vec c:k\\to\\mathsf{PConst}_{570}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span>，定义迭代常元式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k,\\vec c,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k,\\vec c,A)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(0,\\vec c,A)=A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(0,\\vec c,A)=A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k+1,\\vec c,A)=\\operatorname{pconst}(\\vec c(k)):\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k,\\vec c,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k+1,\\vec c,A)=\\operatorname{pconst}(\\vec c(k)):\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k,\\vec c,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由符号与替换\">3. 自由符号与替换</h1>\n<p>定义自由符号函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{570}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{570}:\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{570}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{570}:\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项和公式均无绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{570}:\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{570}(U)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{570}:\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{570}(U)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜证明变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshP}_{570}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{570})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{570},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{570}(E)=x_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshP}_{570}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{570})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{570},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{570}(E)=x_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\\)</span>。本函数不参与捕获规避，因为本语言无绑定项构造子。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{570}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式中的证明变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{570}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{570}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{570}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(t,\\theta),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(t,\\theta),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(A,\\theta),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(B,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(A,\\theta),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(B,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(A,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{570}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570}(A,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，捕获规避重命名恒为恒等操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,570}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,570}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{570}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{570}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{570}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{570}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{570}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{570}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{570}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{570}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{570}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{570}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{570}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{570}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{570}=\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{570}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{570}=\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{570}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{570},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{570}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{570}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{570}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{570}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{570}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{570}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{570}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Artemov 迭代常元规范参数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\n\\subseteq\n\\{\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k,\\vec c,A):k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ k&gt;0,\\ \\vec c:k\\to\\mathsf{PConst}_{570},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\n\\subseteq\n\\{\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k,\\vec c,A):k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ k&gt;0,\\ \\vec c:k\\to\\mathsf{PConst}_{570},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{570}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}\\cup\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{570}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}\\cup\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{570}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{570}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{570}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{570}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{570}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{570}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,570}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,570}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{570}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{570}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{570}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{570}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-Artemov-LP-证书\">8. Artemov LP 证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"570\">\\(570\\)</span>-证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k,\\vec c,A)\">\\((k,\\vec c,A)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&gt;0\">\\(k&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec c:k\\to\\mathsf{PConst}_{570}\">\\(\\vec c:k\\to\\mathsf{PConst}_{570}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{570}\\)</span>；其输出公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k,\\vec c,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{itcs}_{570}(k,\\vec c,A)\\)</span>，并且只有当该输出属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\">\\(\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\\)</span> 时可作为第 6 节第 3 类证明行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-证据语义载体与后承\">9. 证据语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>原始证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ERaw}_{570}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ERaw}_{570}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{570}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{570}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{570}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{570}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{570}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{570}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{570}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{570}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{570}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{570}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{570}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{570}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{570}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{570}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{570}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{570}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{570}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{570}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{570}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证据闭包条件：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EApp}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EApp}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ESum}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ESum}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EBang}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EBang}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ETrue}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow M,w\\models_{570}A\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ETrue}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow M,w\\models_{570}A\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EICS}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\\ (M,w\\models_{570}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EICS}_{570}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\\ (M,w\\models_{570}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Artemov LP 证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EviMod}_{570}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{570}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{570}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{570}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{570}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ETrue}_{570}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EICS}_{570}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EviMod}_{570}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{570}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{570}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{570}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{570}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ETrue}_{570}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EICS}_{570}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{570}^{\\mathsf e}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{570}^{\\mathsf e}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{570}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{570}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{570}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{570}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{570}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{570}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是迭代常元规范 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\">\\(\\mathsf{ICS}_{570}\\)</span>；它不是只允许单层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:A\">\\(c:A\\)</span> 常元规范的 LP 文件。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{ArtemovLP}_{570}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{570},\\mathsf{PVar}_{570},\\mathsf{PConst}_{570},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{570},\\mathsf{Frm}_{570},\\operatorname{itcs}_{570},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{570},\\operatorname{TV}_{570},\\operatorname{TVF}_{570},\\operatorname{BV}_{570},\\operatorname{freshP}_{570},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{570},\\operatorname{SubT}_{570},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570},\\equiv_{\\alpha,570},\n\\mathsf{ICS}_{570},\\mathsf{Ax}_{570},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{570},\\mathsf{Proof}_{570},\\vdash_{570},\n\\mathsf{ERaw}_{570},\\mathsf{EviMod}_{570},\\models_{570},\\models_{570}^{\\mathsf e}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{ArtemovLP}_{570}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{570},\\mathsf{PVar}_{570},\\mathsf{PConst}_{570},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{570},\\mathsf{Frm}_{570},\\operatorname{itcs}_{570},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{570},\\operatorname{TV}_{570},\\operatorname{TVF}_{570},\\operatorname{BV}_{570},\\operatorname{freshP}_{570},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{570},\\operatorname{SubT}_{570},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{570},\\equiv_{\\alpha,570},\n\\mathsf{ICS}_{570},\\mathsf{Ax}_{570},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{570},\\mathsf{Proof}_{570},\\vdash_{570},\n\\mathsf{ERaw}_{570},\\mathsf{EviMod}_{570},\\models_{570},\\models_{570}^{\\mathsf e}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 Artemov 式显式证明项句法、公理、迭代常元规范、证明对象、可证性、证据模型和语义后承；不含实现定理或与模态系统的对应定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、公式与迭代常元式","text":"2. 项、公式与迭代常元式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由符号与替换","text":"3. 自由符号与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-Artemov-LP-证书","text":"8. Artemov LP 证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-证据语义载体与后承","text":"9. 证据语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{570}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PVar}_{570}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PConst}_{570}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sum}(s,t)=s+t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{app}(s,t)=s\\cdot t,\\quad\n\\operatornam